    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What's appealing?</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A world that is constantly circulating, and there are many ways to accumulate strength</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Living in the city, there are many different games that will earn you different prizes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582130/extras/f29a44602ff1a990aa2b011926e72f59.avif?t=1750205300\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Time Management</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A limited number of loops, a limited amount of time, a test of how you use your time to make yourself stronger</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582130/extras/c5102a51fedb718f9eb1b944155213d2.avif?t=1750205300\" data-has-big width=800 height=354 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A fusion of parry and turn-based combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A decisive blow that blocks all damage</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582130/extras/2613cc24b6aba3b71cbf055d0e818f87.avif?t=1750205300\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Defeat the bad guys and repent</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Punish these evildoers severely</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Estimated visiting time: 6 hours</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What's appealing?</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A world that is constantly circulating, and there are many ways to accumulate strength</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Living in the city, there are many different games that will earn you different prizes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582130/extras/f29a44602ff1a990aa2b011926e72f59.avif?t=1750205300\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Time Management</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A limited number of loops, a limited amount of time, a test of how you use your time to make yourself stronger</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582130/extras/c5102a51fedb718f9eb1b944155213d2.avif?t=1750205300\" data-has-big width=800 height=354 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A fusion of parry and turn-based combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A decisive blow that blocks all damage</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582130/extras/2613cc24b6aba3b71cbf055d0e818f87.avif?t=1750205300\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Defeat the bad guys and repent</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Punish these evildoers severely</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Estimated visiting time: 6 hours</p>",
